@baseUrl = http://localhost:8094

### Get all flags
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/flags

### Get flags by tag
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/flags?tag=problem_pattern

### Get flag by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/flags/db_not_responding

### Enable a flag
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/flags/db_not_responding
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": true}

### Disable a flag
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/flags/db_not_responding
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": false}

### Get the portfolio insights flag
# Portfolio insights (demo feature, not financial advice). Flag id is hyphenated: portfolio-insights-enabled.
# Walkthrough, variables (ENABLE_PORTFOLIO_INSIGHTS, ALERT_EVALUATION_INTERVAL_SECONDS, PORTFOLIO_INSIGHTS_ALERT_WEIGHT) and the database recreate note: ../../README.md#portfolio-insights-demo-feature
# The feature endpoints are not served here; see ../broker-service/broker-service.http and ../broker-service/README.md#portfolio-insights-and-alerts
# While the flag is off, every feature endpoint in broker-service answers 403 {"error":"feature_disabled"}.
# The flag is not listed by ?tag=problem_pattern (the /feature-flags page); use ?tag=feature below.
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/flags/portfolio-insights-enabled

### Enable portfolio insights (walkthrough step 1)
# broker-service applies it on its next request, a visible frontend tab within about 15 s; a restart restores the startup default; 400 when ENABLE_MODIFY=false.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/flags/portfolio-insights-enabled
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": true}

### Disable portfolio insights
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/flags/portfolio-insights-enabled
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": false}

### Get flags by tag feature
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/flags?tag=feature

### Version
GET {{baseUrl}}/version
